 keycard sandbox   setup · step 2 of 5

  Zone and user
  A zone is a Keycard workspace with its own users and apps. Pick one you use
  for testing, because the sandbox turns on its own access rules there. Then
  pick who the agent acts as, usually you. Every demo has an agent for them.
  Only people who have signed in to the zone are listed.

  Which zone does the sandbox use?
